==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 4~20 seconds<sup>120f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

